  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br>Welcome to The Palm 30A by Bonheur, an opulent coastal retreat where barefoot luxury meets the effortless rhythm of beach life—just steps from the sugar-white sands of Inlet Beach. Here, the Gulf is not a destination; it’s part of the daily soundtrack. The salt air, the shimmer of turquoise water, and the soft crunch of sand underfoot are always moments away.<br><br>Designed for discerning groups and families, this expansive seven-bedroom estate blends timeless 30A charm with elevated coastal design and indulgent comfort. Whether you’re gathering generations under one roof, hosting a friends’ getaway, or celebrating life’s milestones seaside, The Palm 30A offers space, sophistication, and serenity in equal measure.<br><br>Begin your mornings on the rooftop deck, coffee in hand, as the sun crests the horizon and bathes the dunes in warm gold. Gulf breezes drift through as the day slowly unfolds. Afternoons invite you poolside, where the private resort-style pool is framed by cushioned chaises, outdoor dining, and a grill—perfect for long lunches, sunset cocktails, and lingering conversations under the Florida sky. And when the ocean beckons, the beach is only a short stroll away, making spontaneous swims and sunset walks effortlessly part of your stay.<br><br>Inside, the home is awash in natural light, highlighting a refined coastal palette, warm wood flooring, and thoughtfully curated furnishings that feel both luxurious and welcoming. The open-concept living space flows seamlessly from the chef-inspired, fully equipped kitchen—complete with generous island seating and two elegant dining areas—to a plush TV lounge designed for relaxed evenings after sun-filled days.<br><br>Sleeping accommodations are equally impressive, comfortably hosting up to 23 guests. Five of the seven bedrooms feature private ensuite bathrooms, offering hotel-level privacy, while two beautifully designed bunk rooms create the perfect haven for younger guests or late-night storytelling. Throughout the home, plush bedding, spa-like bathrooms, and inviting gathering spaces ensure every guest feels indulged and at ease.<br><br>Step beyond the property and discover the best of 30A living. You’re minutes from the boutiques, acclaimed dining, bike trails, and architectural beauty of Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach, and Seacrest. Spend your days beach-hopping, browsing local farmers markets, or savoring fresh seafood dinners al fresco—always knowing your private coastal sanctuary awaits just moments away.<br><br>Ready for your most unforgettable beach escape?<br>The Palm 30A by Bonheur is ready to welcome you.<br><br>30A is a breathtaking 20-mile ribbon of coastline stretching from Inlet Beach to Dune Allen, where sugar-white sands meet some of the most architecturally distinctive beach towns in the country. Along this celebrated corridor, you’ll find crystalline Gulf waters, thoughtfully designed communities, and a coastal lifestyle that balances relaxed elegance with inspired living. From modernist masterpieces and New Urbanist icons to bohemian hideaways and nature-preserved enclaves, each town offers its own aesthetic, rhythm, and story—inviting you to explore, linger, and fall in love with every mile.<br><br>The Bonheur Hospitality Experience<br>This is hospitality without limits.<br><br>At Bonheur, we don’t wait to be asked—we anticipate. Every stay is thoughtfully orchestrated by a local team of hospitality experts who believe excellence lives in the details and magic happens in the moments you never have to think about.<br><br>From fully stocked refrigerators and private chefs to in-home massages, seamless transportation, elevated beach experiences, baby gear, and flawlessly executed celebrations, our Concierge Service is designed to remove friction and replace it with delight. Big requests. Small wishes. Last-minute pivots. We handle it—all with grace, speed, and intention.<br><br>And when you reach out?<br>You’re not routed. You’re not waiting.<br>You’re texting a real local, who knows the area, knows your home, and knows how to deliver—immediately.<br><br>This isn’t service.<br>It’s confidence.<br>It’s care.<br>It’s Bonheur.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "The Palm 30a Opulent 7bdrm home Steps from the Beach. Golf cart, heated pool."
        }
      ],
